*** Keywords ***
Check Blackbox Rmod Soc Family Version
    [Documentation]
    ...  Checks SOC family version of the rmod. Blackbox SOC family version should be equal to the expected SOC family
    ...  version.
    [Arguments]                                 ${path_to_blackbox_file}
    ...                                         ${expected_soc_family_version}
    Robot Log Operation                         Verifying RMOD's SOC version in blackbox file...
    rmod_blackbox.set_blackbox_file             path_to_blackbox_file=${path_to_blackbox_file}
    rmod_blackbox.verify_soc_family_version     expected_soc_family_version=${expected_soc_family_version}


Check Blackbox Rmod Product Code
    [Documentation]
    ...  Checks product code of the rmod. Blackbox product code should be equal to the product code from WEBEM.
    [Arguments]                                 ${path_to_blackbox_file}
    ...                                         ${rmod_id}
    ...                                         ${connection}
    Robot Log Operation                         Verifying RMOD's product code in blackbox file...
    ${rmod_product_code}=                       admin_info_model.get_product_code_for_rmod
    ...                                         rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    rmod_blackbox.set_blackbox_file             path_to_blackbox_file=${path_to_blackbox_file}
    rmod_blackbox.verify_product_code           expected_product_code=${rmod_product_code}


